            "name": "B2B Onboarding & Wholesale",
            "tagline": "When trade customers apply, get approved and order at their pricing on the same Shopify store.",
            "description": "<p>The front door Shopify B2B does not ship: the application form, the resale certificate, the review, the approval, and the company created in Shopify with the right catalog and payment terms. Ours; it grew out of the trade programs we built for tile and paint brands.</p>",
