            "tagline": "When repeat purchase is the business: subscriptions, bundles, upsells and loyalty in one app.",
            "description": "<p>Subscriptions with no transaction fees, bundles, upsells and loyalty, built for established brands on Shopify. Ours, and one of several good options; we also work in whichever subscription app a brand already runs.</p>",
